/android/app/profile
/android/app/release
/.codegraph
.worktrees/

# FVM Version Cache
.fvm/

# 禁止本地 CocoaPods vendor，OrderedSet 等依赖走远程 trunk
ios/vendor/
/packages/infrastructure/dokit/example/local.properties

# OpenHarmony / OHOS — 本地构建产物与机器相关依赖
# （ohos/.gitignore 只覆盖 /ohos；组件目录下的 ohos/ 需在此声明）
**/ohos/build/
**/ohos/.hvigor/
**/ohos/node_modules/
**/ohos/local.properties
**/ohos/oh-package-lock.json5
**/ohos/oh_modules/flutter_native_x86_64
**/ohos/BuildProfile.ets

# DevEco 本地写入的签名配置（含密钥路径/口令）；克隆后复制 example 为 build-profile.json5
/ohos/build-profile.json5
